{
  "_comment": [
    "env.manifest.json - the source of truth for the ignite-server container's environment.",
    "REQ-092. Populated from `aws ecs describe-task-definition ignite-upside-down:1077` on 2026-09-01;",
    "readers verified by grep of os.Getenv/LookupEnv over upside-down/ at that commit.",
    "",
    "class:  kill     = kill switch / feature flag",
    "        route    = routing / transport / allow-list flag (can silence the send path)",
    "        capacity = throughput or volume knob",
    "        infra    = endpoint, bucket, region, channel",
    "        secret   = value NEVER in git; carried verbatim from the running revision",
    "        stamp    = written by prepare_task_definition.py at register time",
    "        removed  = stripped from the next registered revision",
    "",
    "value:  a string  -> prepare_task_definition.py upserts exactly this value",
    "        null      -> not managed here (secret passthrough / stamp / documented default)",
    "flags:  default   -> read in code but deliberately UNSET; must stay absent",
    "        optional  -> may be injected from the deploy shell (PASSTHROUGH_ENV_VARS)",
    "        absent_ok -> class removed and already gone from the running revision",
    "",
    "EVERY key present in the running revision must appear here or the deploy FAILS.",
    "Changing a value here + `deploy/deploy.sh --config-only` replaces the hand-run",
    "`aws ecs register-task-definition` that produced 10 unreviewed revisions in 14 days."
  ],
  "container": "ignite-server",
  "sidecar": {
    "name": "review-forge-engine",
    "image": "146361001621.dkr.ecr.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/ignite-review-forge:1c6cac5",
    "note": "pinned since :780 (2026-06-17); a normal deploy carries it forward untouched. Set REVIEW_FORGE_IMAGE in the deploy shell to move it."
  },
