      "note": "REQ-090 RUNTIME kill switch for send routing (FlagGate 'send_route', cmd/server/eventbus_wiring.go). Deploy-time default is the routing predicate itself, so leaving this UNSET changes nothing. The operator lever is Redis, not env: SET kafka:flag:send_route 0 turns routing off fleet-wide in ~15s with no task-def revision; DEL restores the env decision. A '1' can never route mail the KAFKA_SEND_QUEUE_* envs do not already route — the flag only ever removes volume. Resolved value on /health.event_bus.flags.send_route",
